---
import "../styles/homepage.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Unroot Design is a 5 person website design and build studio in Warsaw for funded AI and tech startups.">
  <title>Unroot Design, website design and build for AI and tech startups</title>

</head>
<body>
  <div class="shell">
    <aside class="rail">
      <div class="rail-top">
        <a class="logo" href="#top">unroot<span>.</span></a>
        <button class="command-button" type="button" data-open-command><span>Search</span><kbd>⌘K</kbd></button>
      </div>

      <div class="hero" id="top">
        <div class="availability"><i></i><span>2 slots left in October. Next opening December.</span></div>
        <h1>Website design and build for funded AI and tech startups.</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy"><strong>5 people in Warsaw.</strong> We work with pre-seed to Series A teams, mostly in the US, UK, Canada and Australia. Start with a 7 day concept.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#concept"><span>get a concept, $1,499</span><span>↘</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="mailto:adam@unroot.design?subject=Intro%20call"><span>book call</span><span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat"><strong>9 years</strong><span>doing the work</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>100+</strong><span>brands</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>$130M+</strong><span>raised by clients</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rail-foot">
        <nav><a href="#work">work</a><a href="#pricing">pricing</a><a href="#team">team</a><a href="#faq">faq</a></nav>
        <span>Warsaw, Poland</span>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="feed">
      <header class="feed-nav">
        <a class="mobile-brand" href="#top">unroot.</a>
        <strong>Concept to shipped website</strong>
        <nav><a href="#concept">Concept</a><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="#footer">Contact</a></nav>
      </header>

      <section class="section" id="concept">
        <div class="section-head">
          <div><span class="kicker">01, the Concept</span><h2>Send a link. Get a direction in 7 days.</h2></div>
          <p>No brief. No moodboard. No discovery call. You send your current website. 7 days later, you get 1 homepage direction in Figma, hero plus 3 sections, with an animated scroll preview.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="concept-stage">
          <div class="concept-toolbar">
            <div class="project-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Concept examples">
              <button class="project-tab active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" data-project="Javelin VP" data-before="/homepage/img/p-javelin-before.jpg" data-after-image="/homepage/img/p-javelin-after.jpg">Javelin VP</button>
              <button class="project-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-project="Switch" data-before="/homepage/img/p-switch-before.jpg" data-after-image="/homepage/img/p-switch-after.jpg">Switch</button>
              <button class="project-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-project="Epsilon Health" data-before="/homepage/img/p-epsilon-before.jpg" data-after-image="/homepage/img/p-epsilon-after.jpg">Epsilon</button>
              <button class="project-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-project="Ambient Dreamie" data-before="/homepage/img/p-dreamie-before.jpg" data-after-image="/homepage/img/p-dreamie-after.jpg">Dreamie</button>
              <button class="project-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-project="ResumAI" data-before="/homepage/img/p-resumai-before.jpg" data-after-image="/homepage/img/p-resumai-after.jpg">ResumAI</button>
              <button class="project-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-project="Leadgains" data-before="/homepage/img/p-leadgains-before.jpg" data-after-image="/homepage/img/p-leadgains-after.jpg">Leadgains</button>
            </div>
            <div class="concept-price">drag to compare</div>
          </div>
          <div class="compare" data-compare>
            <div class="compare-panel compare-before">
              <img data-before-image src="/homepage/img/p-javelin-before.jpg" alt="Javelin VP website before redesign" width="620" height="1033" fetchpriority="high">
              <span class="mock-label" data-before-label>Before, Javelin VP</span>
            </div>
            <div class="compare-panel compare-after" data-after>
              <img data-concept-image src="/homepage/img/p-javelin-after.jpg" alt="Javelin VP homepage concept" width="620" height="1033">
              <span class="mock-label" data-after-label>7 day concept, Javelin VP</span>
            </div>
            <div class="compare-handle" data-handle></div>
            <input class="compare-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="56" aria-label="Reveal the homepage concept" data-compare-range>
          </div>
          <div class="compare-caption"><span>Drag to compare the original website with our homepage concept.</span><span>Select a project above to explore another direction.</span></div>

        <div class="concept-details">
          <div class="offer-card">
            <h3>1 direction. One shot.</h3>
            <p>The Concept is fixed. No revisions. If you move into the full redesign within 60 days, the $1,499 is credited. If you do not, you keep the Figma file.</p>
            <div class="offer-points">
              <div><strong>hero + 3 sections</strong>Custom homepage direction in Figma.</div>
              <div><strong>animated preview</strong>Scroll motion, not a flat mockup.</div>
              <div><strong>7 days</strong>From current website link to concept.</div>
              <div><strong>yours to keep</strong>Use the file however you want.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mini-card"><div><span class="kicker">Entry point</span><div class="big">$1,499<br>7 days</div></div><p>Finding out on day 7 beats finding out on week 4.</p></div>
        </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="play-head"><div><span class="kicker">02, concept board</span><p>Move the concept covers around. Explore a few of our directions.</p></div><button class="reset" type="button" data-reset>reset board</button></div>
        <div class="play-card">
          <div class="board" data-board>
            <div class="drag" data-drag><img src="/homepage/img/c-oramedia.jpg" alt="Oramedia concept cover" loading="lazy" draggable="false"><span>Oramedia</span></div><div class="drag" data-drag><img src="/homepage/img/c-resumai.jpg" alt="ResumAI concept cover" loading="lazy" draggable="false"><span>ResumAI</span></div><div class="drag" data-drag><img src="/homepage/img/c-rezi.jpg" alt="Rezi concept cover" loading="lazy" draggable="false"><span>Rezi</span></div><div class="drag" data-drag><img src="/homepage/img/c-switch.jpg" alt="Switch concept cover" loading="lazy" draggable="false"><span>Switch</span></div><div class="drag" data-drag><img src="/homepage/img/c-dreamie.jpg" alt="Ambient Dreamie concept cover" loading="lazy" draggable="false"><span>Ambient Dreamie</span></div><div class="drag" data-drag><img src="/homepage/img/c-leadgains.jpg" alt="Leadgains concept cover" loading="lazy" draggable="false"><span>Leadgains</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="work">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">03, shipped work</span><h2>Concepts are fast. The finished work still has to hold up.</h2></div><p>6 shipped projects. From the first direction to the finished website.</p></div>
        <div class="work-grid">
          <article class="case" id="work-dreamie"><div class="case-visual"><img src="/homepage/img/w-dreamie-1.jpg" alt="Ambient Dreamie, project image 1" loading="lazy"><img src="/homepage/img/w-dreamie-2.jpg" alt="Ambient Dreamie, project image 2" loading="lazy" hidden><img src="/homepage/img/w-dreamie-3.jpg" alt="Ambient Dreamie, project image 3" loading="lazy" hidden><div class="case-controls"><button type="button" data-case-image="0" aria-label="Show Ambient Dreamie image 1" aria-pressed="true">1</button><button type="button" data-case-image="1" aria-label="Show Ambient Dreamie image 2" aria-pressed="false">2</button><button type="button" data-case-image="2" aria-label="Show Ambient Dreamie image 3" aria-pressed="false">3</button></div></div><div class="case-content"><div class="case-top"><h3>Ambient Dreamie</h3><span class="case-year">2025</span></div><p>Built the brand and digital experience for a wellness startup that raised $550K on light-based sleep science.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">brand</span><span class="tag">3d</span><span class="tag">website</span><span class="tag">healthtech</span></div></div></article>
          <article class="case" id="work-switch"><div class="case-visual"><img src="/homepage/img/w-switch-1.jpg" alt="Switch, project image 1" loading="lazy"><img src="/homepage/img/w-switch-2.jpg" alt="Switch, project image 2" loading="lazy" hidden><img src="/homepage/img/w-switch-3.jpg" alt="Switch, project image 3" loading="lazy" hidden><div class="case-controls"><button type="button" data-case-image="0" aria-label="Show Switch image 1" aria-pressed="true">1</button><button type="button" data-case-image="1" aria-label="Show Switch image 2" aria-pressed="false">2</button><button type="button" data-case-image="2" aria-label="Show Switch image 3" aria-pressed="false">3</button></div></div><div class="case-content"><div class="case-top"><h3>Switch</h3><span class="case-year">2025</span></div><p>Built the digital foundation for a next-generation payments platform with 100K+ active users.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">website</span><span class="tag">fintech</span></div></div></article>
          <article class="case" id="work-javelinvp"><div class="case-visual"><img src="/homepage/img/w-javelin-1.jpg" alt="Javelin VP, project image 1" loading="lazy"><img src="/homepage/img/w-javelin-2.jpg" alt="Javelin VP, project image 2" loading="lazy" hidden><img src="/homepage/img/w-javelin-3.jpg" alt="Javelin VP, project image 3" loading="lazy" hidden><div class="case-controls"><button type="button" data-case-image="0" aria-label="Show Javelin VP image 1" aria-pressed="true">1</button><button type="button" data-case-image="1" aria-label="Show Javelin VP image 2" aria-pressed="false">2</button><button type="button" data-case-image="2" aria-label="Show Javelin VP image 3" aria-pressed="false">3</button></div></div><div class="case-content"><div class="case-top"><h3>Javelin VP</h3><span class="case-year">2024</span></div><p>Crafted the brand and digital platform for a $125M seed and Series A venture capital fund.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">website</span><span class="tag">vc</span></div></div></article>
          <article class="case" id="work-trustyfy"><div class="case-visual"><img src="/homepage/img/w-trustyfy-1.jpg" alt="Trustyfy, project image 1" loading="lazy"><img src="/homepage/img/w-trustyfy-2.jpg" alt="Trustyfy, project image 2" loading="lazy" hidden><img src="/homepage/img/w-trustyfy-3.jpg" alt="Trustyfy, project image 3" loading="lazy" hidden><div class="case-controls"><button type="button" data-case-image="0" aria-label="Show Trustyfy image 1" aria-pressed="true">1</button><button type="button" data-case-image="1" aria-label="Show Trustyfy image 2" aria-pressed="false">2</button><button type="button" data-case-image="2" aria-label="Show Trustyfy image 3" aria-pressed="false">3</button></div></div><div class="case-content"><div class="case-top"><h3>Trustyfy</h3><span class="case-year">2025</span></div><p>Built a next-gen fintech experience for a $6.8M funded payments startup.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">website</span><span class="tag">fintech</span></div></div></article>
          <article class="case" id="work-workshop-film-co"><div class="case-visual"><img src="/homepage/img/w-workshop-1.jpg" alt="Workshop Film Co., project image 1" loading="lazy"><img src="/homepage/img/w-workshop-2.jpg" alt="Workshop Film Co., project image 2" loading="lazy" hidden><img src="/homepage/img/w-workshop-3.jpg" alt="Workshop Film Co., project image 3" loading="lazy" hidden><div class="case-controls"><button type="button" data-case-image="0" aria-label="Show Workshop Film Co. image 1" aria-pressed="true">1</button><button type="button" data-case-image="1" aria-label="Show Workshop Film Co. image 2" aria-pressed="false">2</button><button type="button" data-case-image="2" aria-label="Show Workshop Film Co. image 3" aria-pressed="false">3</button></div></div><div class="case-content"><div class="case-top"><h3>Workshop Film Co.</h3><span class="case-year">2025</span></div><p>Shaped the brand and web presence for a production studio driving $770K in annual revenue.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">brand</span><span class="tag">website</span><span class="tag">film</span></div></div></article>
          <article class="case" id="work-epsilon-health"><div class="case-visual"><img src="/homepage/img/w-epsilon-1.jpg" alt="Epsilon Health, project image 1" loading="lazy"><img src="/homepage/img/w-epsilon-2.jpg" alt="Epsilon Health, project image 2" loading="lazy" hidden><img src="/homepage/img/w-epsilon-3.jpg" alt="Epsilon Health, project image 3" loading="lazy" hidden><div class="case-controls"><button type="button" data-case-image="0" aria-label="Show Epsilon Health image 1" aria-pressed="true">1</button><button type="button" data-case-image="1" aria-label="Show Epsilon Health image 2" aria-pressed="false">2</button><button type="button" data-case-image="2" aria-label="Show Epsilon Health image 3" aria-pressed="false">3</button></div></div><div class="case-content"><div class="case-top"><h3>Epsilon Health</h3><span class="case-year">2025</span></div><p>Designed the digital platform for a MedTech company transforming radiology imaging workflows.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">website</span><span class="tag">medtech</span></div></div></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="process">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">04, how it runs</span><h2>Start without a meeting.</h2></div><p>No account managers between you and the people doing the work.</p></div>
        <div class="process">
          <article class="step"><strong>Day 1</strong><div><h3>Send the link.</h3><p>Pay through Stripe. No call needed to start.</p></div></article>
          <article class="step"><strong>Day 7</strong><div><h3>The concept lands.</h3><p>You react. If it is wrong, you keep the file and we shake hands.</p></div></article>
          <article class="step"><strong>Week 2 to 5</strong><div><h3>Design and build.</h3><p>The rest gets designed and built in Webflow or Framer, then handed over.</p></div></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="pricing">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">05, pricing</span><h2>3 ways in.</h2></div><p>Start with a concept, book 1 focused week, or take a full month.</p></div>
        <div class="pricing">
          <article class="price-card featured"><span class="label">Concept in 7 days</span><div class="price">$1,499</div><p>1 homepage direction in Figma, hero plus 3 sections. Animated scroll preview. Credited toward the full redesign within 60 days.</p><p>Yours to keep. No revisions, it is a fixed concept.</p><div class="spacer"></div><a href="mailto:adam@unroot.design?subject=Concept"><span>get a concept</span><span>↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="price-card"><span class="label">Trial week</span><div class="price">$2,499</div><p>For when you already know what needs doing. Design, build, or both.</p><p>Private Slack channel from day 1. Daily output, not a weekly report. Ends on Friday, no notice period.</p><div class="spacer"></div><a href="mailto:adam@unroot.design?subject=Trial%20week"><span>book a week</span><span>↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="price-card"><span class="label">A month</span><div class="price">$7,899</div><p>1 senior designer, 1 senior developer, art direction. A landing page designed and built, or a whole website designed, inside 4 weeks.</p><p>Unlimited requests inside the month. Pause or stop before the next block starts.</p><div class="spacer"></div><a href="mailto:adam@unroot.design?subject=Monthly%20project"><span>book call</span><span>↗</span></a></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="reviews">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">06, clients</span><h2>Direct work. Direct feedback.</h2></div><p>The first 3 testimonials are verified on Trustpilot.</p></div>
        <div class="review-carousel" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Client reviews">
        <div class="quotes" id="review-slides">
          <article class="quote" data-review role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="1 of 4"><blockquote>“We could not have been happier with his work and strongly recommend him to any future clients. He is creative and very timely with responses.”</blockquote><footer><img class="avatar" src="/homepage/img/av-tasnia.jpg" alt="Tasnia Huque" width="38" height="38" loading="lazy"><div class="person"><strong>Tasnia Huque</strong><span>Principal at Javelin VP</span></div><a class="review-source" href="https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/68811a779569d1770b673aba" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read on Trustpilot ↗</a></footer></article>
          <article class="quote" data-review role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="2 of 4" hidden><blockquote>“Collaboration was smooth from design through build, and they handled every detail with care.”</blockquote><footer><img class="avatar" src="/homepage/img/av-adrian.jpg" alt="Adrian Canoso" width="38" height="38" loading="lazy"><div class="person"><strong>Adrian Canoso</strong><span>CEO and Co-Founder at Ambient Dreamie</span></div><a class="review-source" href="https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/68dad10cbf77717f3c8e7895" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read on Trustpilot ↗</a></footer></article>
          <article class="quote" data-review role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="3 of 4" hidden><blockquote>“Adam and his team excel in both design and development, consistently delivering high-quality work with clear and timely communication.”</blockquote><footer><img class="avatar" src="/homepage/img/av-jonah.jpg" alt="Jonah Neuss" width="38" height="38" loading="lazy"><div class="person"><strong>Jonah Neuss</strong><span>Wow House Studio</span></div><a class="review-source" href="https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/68800cfb2b8ce173b31d4fce" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read on Trustpilot ↗</a></footer></article>
          <article class="quote" data-review role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="4 of 4" hidden><blockquote>“The designs are honestly some of the coolest stuff I have seen out there.”</blockquote><footer><img class="avatar" src="/homepage/img/av-rokas.jpg" alt="Rokas Judickas" width="38" height="38" loading="lazy"><div class="person"><strong>Rokas Judickas</strong><span>Founding designer at Sintra.ai</span></div></footer></article>
