      <section class="section" id="services">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">07, services</span><h2>What we do.</h2></div><p>Website design, development and the visual identity around it.</p></div>
        <div class="list-card"><div class="list-title">Services</div><div class="list-row"><span>Website design</span><span>Webflow and Framer</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Vibe coding</span><span>build</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Logo and brand identity</span><span>brand</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Design systems</span><span>systems</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>3D and motion</span><span>visuals</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Landing pages</span><span>launch</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>CMS setup and training</span><span>handover</span></div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="team">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">08, team</span><h2>5 people. No account layer.</h2></div><p>Adam runs the projects. The client works with the people designing and building the website.</p></div>
        <div class="list-card"><div class="list-title">Team</div><div class="list-row"><span>Adam</span><span>design, runs projects</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Eugenia</span><span>senior design</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Alex</span><span>development</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Igor</span><span>design</span></div><div class="list-row"><span>Yuliia</span><span>design</span></div></div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="faq">
        <div class="section-head"><div><span class="kicker">09, faq</span><h2>Before you send the link.</h2></div><p>The short version of what happens, what you own, and where AI fits.</p></div>
        <div class="faq">
          <details><summary>What exactly do I get for $1,499</summary><p>A custom homepage concept in Figma, hero plus 3 sections, a scroll animation, and our take on the direction your redesign should go. Delivered in 7 days.</p></details>
          <details><summary>What if I do not move forward with the full website</summary><p>You keep the concept and can build it however you want. The $1,499 is credited if you upgrade within 60 days. Finding out on day 7 beats finding out on week 4.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Are revisions included in the concept</summary><p>No. It is a fixed concept, 1 direction, one shot. Revisions and evolution happen inside the full project, and that is priced separately.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Can I give input before you start</summary><p>You can share context and we read everything you send. But we do not ask for moodboards or brand kits. You are paying for our call on the direction, not for assembling yours.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Will I be able to edit the website myself afterwards</summary><p>Yes. We build in Webflow or Framer with a real CMS. Your marketing person can swap copy, add a post and publish without calling us. We lock the layout rules early so a text change on desktop does not break tablet.</p></details>
          <details><summary>What happens if you go quiet for a week</summary><p>We do not. You get a private Slack channel with the people doing the work, weekly updates, and a status line on Friday whether or not there is good news. Delays are survivable, silence is what kills projects.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Is an AI doing the design</summary><p>No. We vibe code the build, which is why a month is enough for a full website. The direction, the layout and the taste are ours.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Who owns the files</summary><p>You do. Figma, the Webflow or Framer project, fonts, everything handed over at the end.</p></details>
        </div>
      </section>

